{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 2,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 758.021,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after Mosiah had done as his father had commanded him,",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.917,
      "end": 8.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had made a proclamation throughout all the land,",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.348,
      "end": 12.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the people gathered themselves together throughout all the land,",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.568,
      "end": 15.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might go up to the temple to hear the words",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.488,
      "end": 17.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which king Benjamin should speak unto them.",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.676,
      "end": 20.719,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were a great number,",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.899,
      "end": 23.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so many that they did not number them;",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 23.819,
      "end": 26.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they had multiplied exceedingly",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 26.182,
      "end": 27.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and waxed great in the land.",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 28.673,
      "end": 31.784,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they also took of the firstlings of their flocks,",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 31.964,
      "end": 37.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might offer sacrifice and burnt offerings according to the law of Moses;",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 38.31,
      "end": 41.189,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also that they might give thanks to the Lord their God,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 41.369,
      "end": 44.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had brought them out of the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 45.032,
      "end": 48.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who had delivered them out of the hands of their enemies,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 48.834,
      "end": 55.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had appointed just men to be their teachers, and also a just man to be their king,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.191,
      "end": 58.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had established peace in the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 58.343,
      "end": 61.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who had taught them to keep the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 61.634,
      "end": 63.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might rejoice",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 63.718,
      "end": 66.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be filled with love towards God and all men.",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 67.463,
      "end": 70.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when they came up to the temple,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 70.847,
      "end": 73.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they pitched their tents round about,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 73.628,
      "end": 75.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man according to his family,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 75.991,
      "end": 79.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "consisting of his wife, and his sons, and his daughters,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 79.84,
      "end": 83.88,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their sons, and their daughters, from the eldest down to the youngest,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 84.06,
      "end": 87.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every family being separate one from another.",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 87.898,
      "end": 91.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they pitched their tents round about the temple,",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 91.189,
      "end": 95.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man having his tent with the door thereof towards the temple,",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 96.013,
      "end": 99.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might remain in their tents",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 99.304,
      "end": 103.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hear the words which king Benjamin should speak unto them;",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 103.792,
      "end": 106.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the multitude being so great",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 106.34,
      "end": 108.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that king Benjamin could not teach them all",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 109.167,
      "end": 111.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "within the walls of the temple,",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 111.762,
      "end": 114.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he caused a tower to be erected,",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 114.589,
      "end": 119.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby his people might hear the words which he should speak unto them.",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 120.285,
      "end": 124.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he began to speak to his people from the tower;",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 124.459,
      "end": 129.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they could not all hear his words because of the greatness of the multitude;",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 129.701,
      "end": 133.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he caused that the words which he spake should be written",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 134.107,
      "end": 138.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sent forth among those that were not under the sound of his voice,",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 138.838,
      "end": 141.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might also receive his words.",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 142.212,
      "end": 147.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these are the words which he spake and caused to be written, saying:",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 147.315,
      "end": 148.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My brethren,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 148.702,
      "end": 151.628,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all ye that have assembled yourselves together,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 151.808,
      "end": 155.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "you that can hear my words which I shall speak unto you this day;",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 155.982,
      "end": 158.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have not commanded you to come up hither",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 158.809,
      "end": 161.781,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to trifle with the words which I shall speak,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 161.961,
      "end": 164.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that you should hearken unto me,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 164.463,
      "end": 166.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and open your ears that ye may hear,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 167.104,
      "end": 169.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your hearts that ye may understand,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 169.745,
      "end": 174.389,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your minds that the mysteries of God may be unfolded to your view.",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 175.069,
      "end": 178.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have not commanded you to come up hither that ye should fear me,",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 179.011,
      "end": 183.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or that ye should think that I of myself am more than a mortal man.",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 184.428,
      "end": 186.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I am like as yourselves,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 186.791,
      "end": 190.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "subject to all manner of infirmities in body and mind;",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 190.268,
      "end": 192.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet I have been chosen by this people,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 192.863,
      "end": 194.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and consecrated by my father,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 195.179,
      "end": 197.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and was suffered by the hand of the Lord",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 197.96,
      "end": 201.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should be a ruler and a king over this people;",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 201.437,
      "end": 204.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have been kept and preserved by his matchless power,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 204.914,
      "end": 208.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to serve you with all the might, mind and strength",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 208.391,
      "end": 210.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which the Lord hath granted unto me.",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 211.393,
      "end": 214.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you that as I have been suffered",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 214.313,
      "end": 218.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to spend my days in your service, even up to this time,",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 218.487,
      "end": 220.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have not sought gold nor silver",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 221.175,
      "end": 223.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor any manner of riches of you;",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 224.316,
      "end": 227.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Neither have I suffered that ye should be confined in dungeons,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 227.979,
      "end": 231.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor that ye should make slaves one of another,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 231.317,
      "end": 235.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor that ye should murder, or plunder, or steal, or commit adultery;",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 236.095,
      "end": 240.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor even have I suffered that ye should commit any manner of wickedness,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 240.687,
      "end": 244.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have taught you that ye should keep the commandments of the Lord,",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 245.139,
      "end": 247.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in all things which he hath commanded you\u2014",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 248.466,
      "end": 251.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And even I, myself, have labored",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 251.2,
      "end": 254.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with mine own hands that I might serve you,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 254.491,
      "end": 256.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye should not be laden with taxes,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 257.179,
      "end": 259.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that there should nothing come upon you",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 259.913,
      "end": 262.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was grievous to be borne\u2014",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 262.183,
      "end": 264.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and of all these things which I have spoken,",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 264.871,
      "end": 267.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye yourselves are witnesses this day.",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 267.78,
      "end": 272.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yet, my brethren, I have not done these things that I might boast,",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 272.279,
      "end": 276.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither do I tell these things that thereby I might accuse you;",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 276.592,
      "end": 282.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I tell you these things that ye may know that I can answer a clear conscience before God this day.",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 282.891,
      "end": 285.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you that because I said unto you",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 285.904,
      "end": 288.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I had spent my days in your service,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 288.499,
      "end": 290.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I do not desire to boast,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 290.537,
      "end": 292.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have only been in the service of God.",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 293.678,
      "end": 297.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I tell you these things that ye may learn wisdom;",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 297.341,
      "end": 301.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may learn that when ye are in the service of your fellow beings",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 302.072,
      "end": 304.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye are only in the service of your God.",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 305.12,
      "end": 307.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, ye have called me your king;",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 307.483,
      "end": 309.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if I, whom ye call your king,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 309.939,
      "end": 311.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do labor to serve you,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 311.837,
      "end": 314.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then ought not ye to labor to serve one another?",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 315.675,
      "end": 319.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold also, if I, whom ye call your king,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 319.57,
      "end": 322.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who has spent his days in your service,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 322.536,
      "end": 325.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and yet has been in the service of God,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 325.41,
      "end": 327.314,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do merit any thanks from you,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 327.494,
      "end": 329.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O how you ought to thank your heavenly King!",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 330.635,
      "end": 332.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you, my brethren,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 332.58,
      "end": 335.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if you should render all the thanks and praise",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 335.871,
      "end": 338.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which your whole soul has power to possess,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 338.512,
      "end": 340.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to that God who has created you,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 340.968,
      "end": 343.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and has kept and preserved you,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 343.191,
      "end": 346.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and has caused that ye should rejoice,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 346.204,
      "end": 349.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and has granted that ye should live in peace one with another\u2014",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 350.46,
      "end": 351.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 351.94,
      "end": 355.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if ye should serve him who has created you from the beginning,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 355.742,
      "end": 359.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and is preserving you from day to day, by lending you breath,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 359.451,
      "end": 363.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may live and move and do according to your own will,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 363.207,
      "end": 366.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and even supporting you from one moment to another\u2014",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 366.359,
      "end": 369.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say, if ye should serve him with all your whole souls",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 369.836,
      "end": 372.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet ye would be unprofitable servants.",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 373.07,
      "end": 376.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, all that he requires of you is to keep his commandments;",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 377.151,
      "end": 380.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he has promised you that if ye would keep his commandments",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 381.046,
      "end": 383.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye should prosper in the land;",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 383.502,
      "end": 386.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he never doth vary from that which he hath said;",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 387.026,
      "end": 389.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, if ye do keep his commandments",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 389.76,
      "end": 392.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he doth bless you and prosper you.",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 392.762,
      "end": 395.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, in the first place,",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 395.218,
      "end": 396.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he hath created you,",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 397.07,
      "end": 399.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and granted unto you your lives,",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 399.572,
      "end": 402.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for which ye are indebted unto him.",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 402.806,
      "end": 405.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And secondly, he doth require",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 405.308,
      "end": 408.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye should do as he hath commanded you;",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 408.46,
      "end": 409.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for which if ye do,",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 410.173,
      "end": 411.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he doth immediately bless you;",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 412.118,
      "end": 413.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and therefore he hath paid you.",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 413.877,
      "end": 416.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye are still indebted unto him,",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 416.658,
      "end": 419.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and are, and will be, forever and ever;",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 419.81,
      "end": 422.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, of what have ye to boast?",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 422.905,
      "end": 424.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I ask,",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 424.339,
      "end": 426.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "can ye say aught of yourselves?",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 426.469,
      "end": 427.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I answer you, Nay.",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 427.949,
      "end": 431.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye cannot say that ye are even as much as the dust of the earth;",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 431.937,
      "end": 434.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet ye were created of the dust of the earth;",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 434.996,
      "end": 438.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, it belongeth to him who created you.",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 438.88,
      "end": 443.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, even I, whom ye call your king, am no better than ye yourselves are;",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 443.983,
      "end": 445.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I am also of the dust.",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 446.16,
      "end": 448.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye behold that I am old,",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 448.383,
      "end": 452.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and am about to yield up this mortal frame to its mother earth.",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 453.289,
      "end": 456.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, as I said unto you that I had served you,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 456.952,
      "end": 459.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "walking with a clear conscience before God,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 459.826,
      "end": 464.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so I at this time have caused that ye should assemble yourselves together,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 464.975,
      "end": 466.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might be found blameless,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 467.105,
      "end": 469.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that your blood should not come upon me,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 469.653,
      "end": 473.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when I shall stand to be judged of God of the things",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 473.455,
      "end": 476.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whereof he hath commanded me concerning you.",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 476.689,
      "end": 481.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you that I have caused that ye should assemble yourselves together",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 481.42,
      "end": 484.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might rid my garments of your blood,",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 484.386,
      "end": 488.333,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "at this period of time when I am about to go down to my grave,",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 488.513,
      "end": 490.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might go down in peace,",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 490.783,
      "end": 494.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my immortal spirit may join the choirs above",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 494.353,
      "end": 496.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in singing the praises of a just God.",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 497.262,
      "end": 499.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover, I say unto you",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 499.346,
      "end": 503.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I have caused that ye should assemble yourselves together,",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 503.427,
      "end": 508.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might declare unto you that I can no longer be your teacher, nor your king;",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 508.983,
      "end": 510.655,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For even at this time,",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 510.835,
      "end": 515.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my whole frame doth tremble exceedingly while attempting to speak unto you;",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 516.17,
      "end": 518.26,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the Lord God doth support me,",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 518.44,
      "end": 521.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hath suffered me that I should speak unto you,",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 521.639,
      "end": 528.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hath commanded me that I should declare unto you this day, that my son Mosiah is a king and a ruler over you.",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 529.053,
      "end": 530.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my brethren,",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 530.533,
      "end": 533.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should do as ye have hitherto done.",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 533.917,
      "end": 536.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "As ye have kept my commandments,",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 536.326,
      "end": 538.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the commandments of my father,",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 538.921,
      "end": 544.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have prospered, and have been kept from falling into the hands of your enemies,",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 544.256,
      "end": 547.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so if ye shall keep the commandments of my son,",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 547.873,
      "end": 552.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the commandments of God which shall be delivered unto you by him,",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 552.372,
      "end": 554.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall prosper in the land,",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 554.549,
      "end": 557.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your enemies shall have no power over you.",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 557.923,
      "end": 559.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, O my people,",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 559.543,
      "end": 563.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "beware lest there shall arise contentions among you,",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 563.252,
      "end": 565.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye list to obey the evil spirit,",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 565.847,
      "end": 568.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was spoken of by my father Mosiah.",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 569.267,
      "end": 574.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, there is a wo pronounced upon him who listeth to obey that spirit;",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 574.648,
      "end": 576.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for if he listeth to obey him,",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 577.15,
      "end": 579.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and remaineth and dieth in his sins,",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 579.838,
      "end": 582.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same drinketh damnation to his own soul;",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 582.897,
      "end": 586.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he receiveth for his wages an everlasting punishment,",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "start": 586.792,
      "end": 591.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having transgressed the law of God contrary to his own knowledge.",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "start": 591.791,
      "end": 594.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you, that there are not any among you,",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "start": 594.804,
      "end": 597.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it be your little children",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "start": 597.585,
      "end": 600.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that have not been taught concerning these things,",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "start": 600.876,
      "end": 605.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but what knoweth that ye are eternally indebted to your heavenly Father,",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 186
    },
    {
      "start": 605.7,
      "end": 608.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to render to him all that you have and are;",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 187
    },
    {
      "start": 608.62,
      "end": 611.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also have been taught concerning the records",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 188
    },
    {
      "start": 611.819,
      "end": 616.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contain the prophecies which have been spoken by the holy prophets,",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 189
    },
    {
      "start": 616.364,
      "end": 619.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even down to the time our father, Lehi, left Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 190
    },
    {
      "start": 620.666,
      "end": 624.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also, all that has been spoken by our fathers until now.",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 191
    },
    {
      "start": 624.422,
      "end": 628.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, also, they spake that which was commanded them of the Lord;",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 192
    },
    {
      "start": 628.642,
      "end": 630.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, they are just and true.",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 193
    },
    {
      "start": 631.551,
      "end": 634.105,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, I say unto you, my brethren",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 194
    },
    {
      "start": 634.285,
      "end": 637.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that after ye have known and have been taught all these things,",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 195
    },
    {
      "start": 637.994,
      "end": 639.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye should transgress",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 196
    },
    {
      "start": 639.799,
      "end": 642.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and go contrary to that which has been spoken,",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 197
    },
    {
      "start": 642.998,
      "end": 646.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye do withdraw yourselves from the Spirit of the Lord,",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 198
    },
    {
      "start": 646.475,
      "end": 648.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it may have no place in you",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 199
    },
    {
      "start": 648.838,
      "end": 651.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to guide you in wisdom's paths",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 200
    },
    {
      "start": 651.201,
      "end": 654.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may be blessed, prospered, and preserved\u2014",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 201
    },
    {
      "start": 655.225,
      "end": 658.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you, that the man that doeth this,",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 202
    },
    {
      "start": 658.331,
      "end": 661.721,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same cometh out in open rebellion against God;",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 203
    },
    {
      "start": 661.901,
      "end": 664.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he listeth to obey the evil spirit,",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 204
    },
    {
      "start": 665.007,
      "end": 667.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and becometh an enemy to all righteousness;",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 205
    },
    {
      "start": 667.973,
      "end": 670.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, the Lord has no place in him,",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 206
    },
    {
      "start": 670.429,
      "end": 672.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he dwelleth not in unholy temples.",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 207
    },
    {
      "start": 673.431,
      "end": 675.985,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore if that man repenteth not,",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 208
    },
    {
      "start": 676.165,
      "end": 679.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and remaineth and dieth an enemy to God,",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 209
    },
    {
      "start": 679.271,
      "end": 683.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the demands of divine justice do awaken his immortal soul",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 210
    },
    {
      "start": 683.863,
      "end": 686.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to a lively sense of his own guilt,",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 211
    },
    {
      "start": 686.597,
      "end": 690.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which doth cause him to shrink from the presence of the Lord,",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 212
    },
    {
      "start": 690.585,
      "end": 694.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and doth fill his breast with guilt, and pain, and anguish,",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 213
    },
    {
      "start": 694.62,
      "end": 697.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is like an unquenchable fire,",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 214
    },
    {
      "start": 697.401,
      "end": 700.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose flame ascendeth up forever and ever.",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 215
    },
    {
      "start": 700.914,
      "end": 704.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I say unto you, that mercy hath no claim on that man;",
      "verse": "2:39",
      "lineIndex": 216
    },
    {
      "start": 704.67,
      "end": 708.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore his final doom is to endure a never-ending torment.",
      "verse": "2:39",
      "lineIndex": 217
    },
    {
      "start": 709.251,
      "end": 712.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O, all ye old men, and also ye young men,",
      "verse": "2:40",
      "lineIndex": 218
    },
    {
      "start": 712.45,
      "end": 715.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and you little children who can understand my words,",
      "verse": "2:40",
      "lineIndex": 219
    },
    {
      "start": 715.556,
      "end": 719.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have spoken plainly unto you that ye might understand,",
      "verse": "2:40",
      "lineIndex": 220
    },
    {
      "start": 719.683,
      "end": 725.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I pray that ye should awake to a remembrance of the awful situation",
      "verse": "2:40",
      "lineIndex": 221
    },
    {
      "start": 725.436,
      "end": 728.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of those that have fallen into transgression.",
      "verse": "2:40",
      "lineIndex": 222
    },
    {
      "start": 729.088,
      "end": 734.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover, I would desire that ye should consider on the blessed and happy state",
      "verse": "2:41",
      "lineIndex": 223
    },
    {
      "start": 734.33,
      "end": 736.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of those that keep the commandments of God.",
      "verse": "2:41",
      "lineIndex": 224
    },
    {
      "start": 737.018,
      "end": 739.572,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, they are blessed in all things,",
      "verse": "2:41",
      "lineIndex": 225
    },
    {
      "start": 739.752,
      "end": 742.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both temporal and spiritual;",
      "verse": "2:41",
      "lineIndex": 226
    },
    {
      "start": 742.347,
      "end": 744.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if they hold out faithful to the end",
      "verse": "2:41",
      "lineIndex": 227
    },
    {
      "start": 745.035,
      "end": 747.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they are received into heaven,",
      "verse": "2:41",
      "lineIndex": 228
    },
    {
      "start": 747.398,
      "end": 751.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they may dwell with God in a state of never-ending happiness.",
      "verse": "2:41",
      "lineIndex": 229
    },
    {
      "start": 751.897,
      "end": 755.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O remember, remember that these things are true;",
      "verse": "2:41",
      "lineIndex": 230
    },
    {
      "start": 755.188,
      "end": 757.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord God hath spoken it.",
      "verse": "2:41",
      "lineIndex": 231
    }
  ]
}